{
  "translations": {
    "0001": "Chapter 1: Rain Gate\n\nAfter the rain stopped, Lin Zhou opened the city gate，and the guard lit a lamp。 He signaled Lin Zhou to follow the riverbank。",
    "0002": "Chapter 2: Three Bells\n\nThe bell rang past midnight，and Bailu folded the map！ She looked back once，then handed the key to the boatman？",
    "0003": "Chapter 3: Old Tower\n\nWind crossed the old tower；it blew out the last candle。 Gu Yao walked down the stone steps in darkness，“hearing the latch fall”。",
    "0004": "Chapter 4: Under the Bridge\n\nThey found a wooden box beneath the bridge、Inside it held no treasure（only a note dated for that day）。",
    "0005": "Chapter 5: The Mountain Pass\n\nA disciple of the Blue Cloud School waited at the pass for a messenger from Mirror Lake Town. The messenger carried a bronze badge carved with the Tidal Mirror pattern.",
    "0006": "Chapter 6: Seven Lights\n\nThe 星河步 required seven steps through starlight, and the third step had to stop in the middle of the stone bridge. Shen Yan practiced once before leading his companion across.",
    "0007": "Chapter 7: The Last Lantern\n\nEvery lantern in Mirror Lake Village went dark at midnight; only the old tower on the north shore still shone.",
    "0008": "Chapter 8: The Hidden Road\n\nThe Tidal Reflection showed the gate's reflection. When it cracked, the hidden road appeared.",
    "0009": "Chapter 9: The North Gate\n\nBailu gave the key to the boatman, who opened the north gate. The road behind it led to the lighthouse.",
    "0010": "Chapter 10: Three Bells\n\nWhen the rope touched the stone platform, the three bells rang from the bottom of the well. Shen Yan lowered the rope afterward.",
    "0011": "Chapter 11: The Altar\n\nGu Yao took the jewel from the altar. The stone door slowly opened, revealing stairs to the sea.",
    "0012": "Chapter 12: Northward\n\nBailu burned the map so the pursuers could find the village. She remembered the river's direction and set out north alone."
  },
